{"parse":{"title":"Gates","pageid":6833,"revid":74047,"text":{"*":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>In <a href=\"/wiki/Rune_Factory_3:_A_Fantasy_Harvest_Moon\" title=\"Rune Factory 3: A Fantasy Harvest Moon\">Rune Factory 3: A Fantasy Harvest Moon</a>, Gates are magically imbued portals that serve as entrance to the human world, for  <a href=\"/wiki/Monsters_(RF3)\" title=\"Monsters (RF3)\">monster</a>, from the Forest of Beginning, or vice versa. Gates also have elemental properties and affinities; they are vulnerable to their elemental weakness and strong against their own element.\n</p><p>Although the pink-colored gates (Heart Gates) have the Love elemental property, Love is not considered an element. Therefore, Heart Gates resemble Neutral Gates in terms of elemental damage.\n</p><p>Neutral Gates and Gale Gates have the same color, which is why they are often confused.\n</p><p>Party members, befriended monsters and Magic Seeds can damage gates, but, by default, they ignore them and focus on attacking the monsters that the gates produce.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Gate_Types\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gate Types</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Neutral_Gates\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Neutral Gates</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Earth_Gates\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Earth Gates</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Fire_Gates\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Fire Gates</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Gale_Gates\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gale Gates</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Rime_Gates\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Rime Gates</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Eclipse_Gates\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Eclipse Gates</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Halo_Gate\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Halo Gate</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Heart_Gates\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Heart Gates</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Trivia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trivia</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gate_Types\">Gate Types</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Ftherunefactory.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FGates%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Neutral_Gates\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/harvestmoonrunefactory/images/3/3f/Small_Crystal.png/revision/latest?cb=20121112115519\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Small Crystal\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/harvestmoonrunefactory/images/3/3f/Small_Crystal.png/revision/latest?cb=20121112115519\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"27\" height=\"27\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Small Crystal.png\" data-image-key=\"Small_Crystal.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span>Neutral Gates</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Ftherunefactory.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FGates%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><i>\"Green hued vortexes swirling with the pure manifestation of rune energy\"</i>\n</p><p>Neutral Gates are almost identical to Gale Gates, as they are both green. However, there <i>is</i> a tiny difference between them: Neutral Gates emit a darker green light while Gale Gates emit a much brighter green light. Additionally, Neutral Gates take full damage from all attacks; they do not have any elemental affinities or weaknesses.&#160;<span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Some of the Neutral Gates in advanced dungeons, however, may halve all types of damage.&#160;</span>\n</p><p>Since Neutral Gates are non-elemental, the item they drop (<a href=\"/wiki/List_of_Items_(RF3)#Goods\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"List of Items (RF3)\">Small Crystal</a>) is created by Rune Energy being crystallized with all other types of runes - including Rune Spirits. Because of this, Small Crystals are noticeably much more rare than other crystals.\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/harvestmoonrunefactory/images/b/b7/Neutral_Gate.png/revision/latest?cb=20121112114323\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Neutral Gate\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/harvestmoonrunefactory/images/b/b7/Neutral_Gate.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/200?cb=20121112114323\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Neutral Gate.png\" data-image-key=\"Neutral_Gate.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Earth_Gates\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/harvestmoonrunefactory/images/6/6e/EarthCrystal.png/revision/latest?cb=20121112115426\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"EarthCrystal\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/harvestmoonrunefactory/images/6/6e/EarthCrystal.png/revision/latest?cb=20121112115426\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"27\" height=\"27\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"EarthCrystal.png\" data-image-key=\"EarthCrystal.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span>Earth Gates</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Ftherunefactory.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FGates%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><i>\"Earthly imbued swirling vortexes that can sometimes spawn vegetation by its base\"</i>\n</p><p>Earth Gates are light brown in color, resembling the earth.\n</p><p>There are three types of Earth-elemental Gates:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Field Gate, a smaller, static gate.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>Star Gate, a smaller, mobile gate</li></ul>\n<ul><li>and Earth Gate, a larger static gate.</li></ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Earth Gates are Earth elemental gates, so they either have half or great resistance against Earth attacks.</span><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">&#160;However,&#160;</span>Earth Gates are weak to Wind elemental damage - some even take double damage if attacked with Wind magic, or weapons with Wind properties.\n</p><p>They drop <a href=\"/wiki/List_of_Items_(RF3)#Goods\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"List of Items (RF3)\">Earth Crystals</a>: crystallized, resilient Earth energy in the form of a light brown rock.  \n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/harvestmoonrunefactory/images/b/b5/Terra_Gate.png/revision/latest?cb=20121112115007\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Terra Gate\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Terra Gate.png\" data-image-key=\"Terra_Gate.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/harvestmoonrunefactory/images/b/b5/Terra_Gate.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/200?cb=20121112115007\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Fire_Gates\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/harvestmoonrunefactory/images/d/da/FireCrystal.png/revision/latest?cb=20121112115440\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"FireCrystal\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"27\" height=\"27\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"FireCrystal.png\" data-image-key=\"FireCrystal.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/harvestmoonrunefactory/images/d/da/FireCrystal.png/revision/latest?cb=20121112115440\" /></a></span>Fire Gates</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Ftherunefactory.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FGates%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><i>\"Fiery and blazing hot swirling portal that causes heatwaves upon its manifestation\"</i>\n</p><p>Fire Gates are red and orange in color, resembling fire.\n</p><p>There are three types of Fire-elemental Gates:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Fire Gate, a smaller, static gate.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>Blaze Gate, a smaller, mobile gate</li></ul>\n<ul><li>and Flame Gate, a larger static gate.</li></ul>\n<p style=\"margin-top:0.4em;margin-bottom:0.5em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Fire Gates are Fire elemental gates, so they either have half or great resistance against Fire attacks.</span><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">&#160;However, Fire&#160;</span>Gates are weak to Water elemental damage - some even take double damage if attacked with Water magic, or weapons with Water properties.</p>\n<p>They drop <a href=\"/wiki/List_of_Items_(RF3)#Goods\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"List of Items (RF3)\">Fire Crystals</a>: crystals that are shaped like flames and warm to the touch.&#160;  \n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/harvestmoonrunefactory/images/1/11/Pyro_Gate.png/revision/latest?cb=20150824181825\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Pyro Gate\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Pyro Gate.png\" data-image-key=\"Pyro_Gate.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/harvestmoonrunefactory/images/1/11/Pyro_Gate.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/200?cb=20150824181825\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gale_Gates\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/harvestmoonrunefactory/images/5/52/WindCrystal.png/revision/latest?cb=20121112115542\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"WindCrystal\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"27\" height=\"27\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"WindCrystal.png\" data-image-key=\"WindCrystal.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/harvestmoonrunefactory/images/5/52/WindCrystal.png/revision/latest?cb=20121112115542\" /></a></span>Gale Gates</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Ftherunefactory.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FGates%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><i>\"Swirling portals of pure breeze that take form as small, cyclone-like vortexes\"</i>\n</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Gale Gates are green in color - similar to the Neutral Gate's color - resembling air. They are more common than any other gate because wind is always present.</span>\n</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Gale Gates are Wind elemental gates, so they either have half or great resistance against Wind attacks.</span><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">&#160;However,&#160;</span><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Gale Gates are weak to Earth elemental damage - some even take double damage if attacked with Earth magic, or weapons with Earth properties.</span>\n</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">They drop Wind <a href=\"/wiki/List_of_Items_(RF3)#Goods\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"List of Items (RF3)\">Crystals</a>: crystallized wind magic that release a turbulent breeze.</span>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/harvestmoonrunefactory/images/7/70/Gale_Gate.png/revision/latest?cb=20121112115029\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Gale Gate\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Gale Gate.png\" data-image-key=\"Gale_Gate.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/harvestmoonrunefactory/images/7/70/Gale_Gate.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/200?cb=20121112115029\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Rime_Gates\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/harvestmoonrunefactory/images/2/22/WaterCrystal.png/revision/latest?cb=20121112115533\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"WaterCrystal\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"27\" height=\"27\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"WaterCrystal.png\" data-image-key=\"WaterCrystal.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/harvestmoonrunefactory/images/2/22/WaterCrystal.png/revision/latest?cb=20121112115533\" /></a></span>Rime Gates</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Ftherunefactory.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FGates%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><i>\"A water-spouting vortex that gives out a horrendous tidal wave from its raging core\"</i>\n</p><p>Rime Gates are blue in color, which resembles the ocean.\n</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Rime Gates are Water elemental gates, so they either have half or great resistance against Water attacks.</span><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">&#160;However, Rime&#160;</span><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Gates are weak to Fire elemental damage - some even take double damage if attacked with Fire magic, or weapons with Fire properties.</span>\n</p><p>They drop <a href=\"/wiki/List_of_Items_(RF3)#Goods\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"List of Items (RF3)\">Water Crystals</a>: crystallized water engery in the form of a fragile droplet.  \n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/harvestmoonrunefactory/images/b/b5/Rime_Gate.png/revision/latest?cb=20121112114417\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Rime Gate\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Rime Gate.png\" data-image-key=\"Rime_Gate.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/harvestmoonrunefactory/images/b/b5/Rime_Gate.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/200?cb=20121112114417\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Eclipse_Gates\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/harvestmoonrunefactory/images/7/70/Dark_Crystal.png/revision/latest?cb=20121112115150\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Dark Crystal\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"27\" height=\"27\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Dark Crystal.png\" data-image-key=\"Dark_Crystal.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/harvestmoonrunefactory/images/7/70/Dark_Crystal.png/revision/latest?cb=20121112115150\" /></a></span>Eclipse Gates</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Ftherunefactory.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FGates%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D7&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><i>\"Pure, swirling clouds of darkness emerge from its core, which spewss out evil beings of chaotic malevolence\"</i>\n</p><p>Eclipse Gates are purplish black in color, relating to darkness and evil.\n</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Eclipse Gates are Dark elemental gates, so they either have half or great resistance against Dark attacks.</span><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">&#160;However, Eclipse</span><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">&#160;Gates are weak to Light elemental damage - some even take double damage if attacked with Light magic, or weapons with Light properties.</span>\n</p><p>Some Dark Gates in dungeons may drastically reduce damage from all other elements, or be immune to them.\n</p><p>They drop <a href=\"/wiki/List_of_Items_(RF3)#Goods\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"List of Items (RF3)\">Dark Crystals</a>.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/harvestmoonrunefactory/images/a/af/Eclipse_Gate.png/revision/latest?cb=20121112114514\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Eclipse Gate\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Eclipse Gate.png\" data-image-key=\"Eclipse_Gate.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/harvestmoonrunefactory/images/a/af/Eclipse_Gate.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/200?cb=20121112114514\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Halo_Gate\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/harvestmoonrunefactory/images/5/56/Light_Crystal.png/revision/latest?cb=20121112115450\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Light Crystal\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"27\" height=\"27\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Light Crystal.png\" data-image-key=\"Light_Crystal.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/harvestmoonrunefactory/images/5/56/Light_Crystal.png/revision/latest?cb=20121112115450\" /></a></span>Halo Gate</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Ftherunefactory.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FGates%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D8&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><i>\"Swirling vortexes of pure righteousness, their vortex somehow spins like a ring of light, resembling halos\"</i>\n</p><p>Halo Gates are white and light yellow in color, relating to light.\n</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Halo Gates are Light elemental gates, so they either have half or great resistance against Light attacks.</span><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">&#160;However, Halo</span><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">&#160;Gates are weak to Dark elemental damage - some even take double damage if attacked with Dark magic, or weapons with Dark properties.</span>\n</p><p>Some Halo Gates in dungeons may drastically reduce damage from all other elements, or be immune to them.\n</p><p>They drop <a href=\"/wiki/List_of_Items_(RF3)#Goods\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"List of Items (RF3)\">Light Crystals</a>.\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/harvestmoonrunefactory/images/7/7c/Halo_Gate.png/revision/latest?cb=20121112115047\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Halo Gate\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Halo Gate.png\" data-image-key=\"Halo_Gate.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/harvestmoonrunefactory/images/7/7c/Halo_Gate.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/200?cb=20121112115047\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Heart_Gates\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/harvestmoonrunefactory/images/c/c5/Love_Crystal.png/revision/latest?cb=20121112115500\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Love Crystal\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"27\" height=\"27\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Love Crystal.png\" data-image-key=\"Love_Crystal.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/harvestmoonrunefactory/images/c/c5/Love_Crystal.png/revision/latest?cb=20121112115500\" /></a></span>Heart Gates</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Ftherunefactory.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FGates%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D9&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><i>\"Lovely pink-hued swirling vortexes born from the monsters love for the other world\"</i>\n</p><p>Heart Gates are pink in color as pink is considered to be a soft and passionate color, and relates to love.\n</p><p>Heart Gates are Love Elemental gates, so they take full damage from all elements and do not have any elemental affinity or weakness. However, some of them in more advanced dungeons halve all types of damage.\n</p><p>Heart Gates appear less often than any other gate, but they have a higher chance of dropping <a href=\"/wiki/List_of_Items_(RF3)#Goods\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"List of Items (RF3)\">Heart Crystals</a>.\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/harvestmoonrunefactory/images/9/9a/Heart_Gate.png/revision/latest?cb=20121112115138\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Heart Gate\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Heart Gate.png\" data-image-key=\"Heart_Gate.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/harvestmoonrunefactory/images/9/9a/Heart_Gate.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/200?cb=20121112115138\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Ftherunefactory.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FGates%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D10&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>The crystals which the gates drop are similar to the crystals in the Final Fantasy series. The crystals in Final Fantasy also have Fire, Earth, Water and Wind elemental crystals. However, the crystals in the Final Fantasy series are bigger than the crystals in Rune Factory.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261029065322\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show\u2010toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.034 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.044 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 68/1000000\nPost\u2010expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post\u2010expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_harvestmoonrunefactory:pcache:idhash:6833-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20261029065322 and revision id 74047. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}}}